        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e0f5eed-8cfd-4b85-9593-38df4c7ce490).Image",
        "Description": "your assingment today is to take over the helicopter platform and make it yours. 1. Find a way onto the helicopter platform. 2. break the neck of the pilot, take his uniform and throw him off the platform. 3. When you are done with him, move over to the guards. 4. Make them go to sleep by shooting them with a tranqulizer and watch them slowly tip over the edge. 5.when the platform is overtaken take the exit in the helicopter. good luck 47.",
